  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Fund to Fight AIDS Tuberculosis and Malaria Set-Aside for Financial Years 2020-21 to 2022-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment covers the $24.2 million that Australia &apos;set-aside&apos; from its 6th replenishment pledge to the Global Fund to Fight AIDS, Tuberculosis and Malaria. The set-aside is managed by Australia to support Global Fund objectives in the Indo-Pacific.  It includes support to increasing HIV testing, laboratory strengthening, multiple TB prevalence surveys and support to Country Coordinating Mechanisms (CCMs).</narrative>
  </description>
